    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50131" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Valgĭus</span></b> , i,
		m., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>the
				name of a Roman</i>
			 gens. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			T. Valgius Rufus, <i>an epic poet</i>, <i><span class="en">Tib. 4, 1,
				180</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Hor. S. 1, 10,
			82</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			C. Valgius, <i>a rhetorician</i>, <i><span class="en">Quint. 3, 1,
				8</span></i>; <i><span class="en">3, 5,
			17</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			Valgius, father-in-law of Rullus, <i><span class="en">Cic. Agr. 3,
				1, 3</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
